# Added to image stylegrounds by Loenn/libraries/motionSmoothingStylegrounds.lua.
style.parallax.attribute.motionSmoothingHires=High Resolution
style.parallax.description.motionSmoothingHires=Whether this styleground's texture is drawn at six times the usual resolution (1920x1080 for a full screen instead of 320x180).\nIt is then drawn at its own resolution rather than being scaled up, so it stays sharp. Everything else about the styleground is unchanged: position, scroll, speed, fade and looping all still work in 320x180 game pixels.\nA map with one of these forces Motion Smoothing's Fancy rendering mode on while the player is in it, and cannot also use auspicioushelper's material layers.
